{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What if everyone controlled the same character... at the same time!?</strong></i></u><br>\u300cPULL Panic : New PartyGame\u300d<i>\u00a0</i>is a chaotic 2D cooperative platformer where all players grab and drag a single character together to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>This multiplayer party game is packed with hilarious mishaps\u2014every misstep becomes a moment of laughter!</strong></u><br>Work together through cleverly designed obstacles, or dive into chaos with traps that become even trickier when everyone shares control.<br>You'll need quick reactions and perfect teamwork to overcome the wild, fast-paced stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the coordination and enjoy the thrill of speedrunning together\u2014or fail spectacularly and laugh at the wacky, unpredictable character movements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports <strong>2\u20134 player co-op</strong> and <strong>4\u20138 player versus race mode</strong>, both <strong>local and online multiplayer</strong>.<br>Gather your friends and family for frantic, physics-based fun in the ultimate co-op chaos!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808750?t=1751454994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808750?t=1751454994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808750/83c9a0b872066204721a3fb59556a0fe0d7b148e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751454994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808750/83c9a0b872066204721a3fb59556a0fe0d7b148e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751454994","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descrip